== d1_1
Lord Arbiter, please begin.#Layout:Left
In the pre-trial investigation, you need to investigate the ghosts related to the case. #Layout:Left
The pre-trial investigation includes<color=red> three stages: inquiry, travel pass check, evidences addition</color>.#Layout:Left
Through this stage, you can learn more about the current case and the ghosts involved.#Layout:Left
Click on the <color=red>Start Inquiry</color> button, and enter the inquiry stage.#Layout:Left
After the inquiry, the ghosts will hand over their travel pass. #Layout:Left
You need to check whether the information on the traval pass is in accrod with the Book of Life and Death, and complete the Information Comparison Table.#Layout:Left
Finally, you need to ask the ghosts about the evidences. Please use the evidenc box on the top right side to show the evidence and make inquiry. #Layout:Left

    -> END